ent-FoodMeatDemon = arkana meat
    .desc = When you love your girlfriend so much that you want to eat her—literally. High in protein.
ent-FoodMeatDionaRoots = diona branches
    .desc = Crunchy, green, and trying to photosynthesize even in the refrigerator. Do not water! Smells like grass.
ent-FoodMeatFelinid = felinid meat
    .desc = Purrs when heated. Hisses when observed. Perfect for pelmeni and bad ideas.
ent-FoodMeatMilira = milira meat
    .desc = A delicately and faintly sweet cut of meat. Leaves a slight aftertaste in your mouth.
ent-FoodMeatNian = nian meat
    .desc = It's the best eco-friendly alternative to traditional livestock farming! Nutty flavor.
ent-FoodMeatResomi = resomi meat
    .desc = Usually low in fat, with a tender texture and easy digestibility.
ent-FoodMeatSlimeJelly = slime jelly
    .desc = Jelly that refuses to obey the laws of physics or cutlery. If it blinked, you saw nothing.
ent-FoodMeatSwine = trotin meat
    .desc = Fresh, high-quality pork has a neutral smell without any off-putting notes.
ent-FoodMeatTajaran = tajaran meat
    .desc = Why did you have to engineer Barsik? The cat soup was only a joke.
ent-FoodMeatUnath = unath meat
    .desc = Scaly and firm. The knife asks for a vacation afterward.
ent-FoodMeatVulpkanin = vulpkanin meat
    .desc = Suspiciously obscene, disgusting, despicable pink meat. Holy water is a mandatory marinade for removing its immoral taint. Show the universe mercy: put an end to the very existence of this defective race! The world must no longer be defiled by the birth of creatures with this revolting flesh!
ent-FoodNianRamenBowl = nian ramen
    .desc = Exotic fare for those who aren't squeamish about street food. As you eat, a strange taste of dusty attics and old clothes builds in your mouth. The secret of its ingredients is kept under the strictest secrecy. Serve under dim lighting—the only way to avoid seeing that your food suspiciously resembles processed wings...
ent-FoodSaladDiona = diona salad
    .desc = A collection of regenerating plant tissues that still consider themselves sentient. While you eat it, it tries to photosynthesize using the light from your lamp. The manufacturer guarantees that the seeds won't take root in your mucous membranes, and no tree will grow in your lungs. At least, not immediately. The warranty is strictly valid until the moment it is swallowed. If you feel an urge to seek out soil and sunlight after your meal, contact the nearest botanist. Or an exorcist.
ent-FoodSoupRoyalXeno = royal stew
    .desc = A concentrated solution of organic acid in a deep bowl. The rule is simple: if the soup is hissing, it's ready to eat. If it stops hissing, that means it's already digesting the spoon and preparing for you. Eating it while wearing chemical protection is recommended.
ent-FoodSoupFacehugger = facehugger soup
    .desc = A hug-in-a-bowl. It embraces you with flavor. Spoon included, face not included.
ent-FoodDemonHellChiliBowl = hellish Arcanian chili
    .desc = It's like my hot ex-wife. Its spicy aroma seduces you, but the first bite burns away your soul. I couldn't let her go after our farewell dinner, so I simply served her at the table. Swallow the black flame and keep quiet. In a world where nothing living remains, we devour those we love just to make it to dawn. After that, nothing but darkness.
ent-FoodMealBakedResomi = roasted Resomi
    .desc = A gastronomic masterpiece that makes the heart beat faster. The delicate skin of this tiny bird is baked to a crisp, caramelized sheen, beneath which lies incredibly tender pink meat dripping with fragrant juices.
ent-FoodMealMiliraWingsBarbecue = milira wings in holy sauce
    .desc = An angelic spirit is sealed within this breading, doomed to sing beneath the crushing pressure of your jaws. The chef had to confess three times, because this crunch is your greatest sin—one for which you will never be forgiven in heaven. Enjoy your dominion over the heavens; hell can wait.
ent-FoodSlimeBun = slime bun
    .desc = A heat-treated biopolymer with a high sucrose content. Due to the semi-sentient nature of the source material, the bun displays signs of motor activity and attempts to leave the plate.
ent-FoodMealUnathCarpNachos = unathi-style carp nachos
    .desc = Nachos that bite back. The carp adds flavor: well, here we go.
ent-FoodRagoutLeTrottinBowl = le'Trottin ragout
    .desc = A ragout that makes the refrigerator respect you. And fear you a little.
ent-FoodTajawarma = tayarma
    .desc = That legendary delicacy from a dubious stall at the metro junction station. As you bite into this juicy wrap, images of Barsik, the neighbor's missing cat, inexplicably flash before your eyes, while a solitary meow echoes in your head...
ent-FoodFelmeniBowl = felmeni
    .desc = Felmeni: when pelmeni and a felinid met in a microwave and refused to part.
ent-FoodVulpLoaf = vulpine loaf
    .desc = Genetic refuse reduced to a single useful purpose. Thank you for cleansing racial impurity. Do humanity a favor—devour this repulsive parasitic flesh and make sure such vermin never dare be born again. There is no place in the galaxy for this nauseating filth—only in the meat grinder! Sterilize the sector of their unbearable stench until the last degenerate of this despised race is dead! Exterminate, digest, dominate. May the eternal greatness of Humanity shine forth!
